// ==UserScript==
// @name         Dopa's Discord Purifier
// @namespace    https://github.com/dopameanie
// @version      4.1.0
// @description  Cute bulk message purifier for Discord~ ✨ Wipe your own messages from any DM, group or server.
// @author       Bardo & Dopa
// @icon         data:image/webp;base64,
// @homepageURL  https://codemaker66.github.io/discord-stuff/
// @supportURL   https://github.com/codemaker66/discord-stuff/issues
